# Supabase Dashboard → Authentication → URL Configuration:
#   Site URL: http://localhost:3000 (dev) or https://multimodal-ai-interview-coach.vercel.app (prod)
#   Redirect URLs:
#     http://localhost:3000/auth/callback
#     https://multimodal-ai-interview-coach.vercel.app/auth/callback
#
# Email signup (recommended first):
#   Authentication → Providers → Email → ON
#   Optional dev: disable "Confirm email" for instant login
#
# Google OAuth (later):
#   1. Supabase → Authentication → Providers → Google → Enable + Client ID/Secret
#   2. Google Cloud Console → OAuth redirect: https://ttgdcomdfqmbqqiywoxw.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#   3. Set NEXT_PUBLIC_OAUTH_GOOGLE_ENABLED=true on Vercel / .env.local
#
# Facebook OAuth (later):
#   1. Supabase → Providers → Facebook → Enable
#   2. Meta Developers → Valid OAuth Redirect: https://ttgdcomdfqmbqqiywoxw.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#   3. Set NEXT_PUBLIC_OAUTH_FACEBOOK_ENABLED=true
